  "title": "Kochira Katsushikaku Kameari Kouenmae Hashutsujo (1996)",
  "justification": "AniDB lists 372 regular episodes against TVDB 111011's 344 in season 1 and 29 in season 0, because AniDB counts each segment of the long TV specials as an episode; the default k = S1Ek holds only for 1-33 and then drifts by up to 29. By the Japanese titles on both sides: 35 ハイパー小学生vs両津 is S1E34 Hyper Elementary Students vs. Ryotsu; 34, 36 and 37 are the three parts named in S0E3 SP1; 70 is S0E4 SP2, 82 S0E5, 94 S0E6, through 361 S0E20; TVDB two-part slots take two AniDB episodes (S1E98 = 104 and 106, S1E121 = 130 and 132, S1E147 = 158 and 160, S1E160 = 173 and 174, S1E234 = 255 and 256); 47 and 48 are swapped on TVDB (S1E45 and S1E44); 372 さよなら両さん大作戦 is S1E344 (2004-12-19). AniDB 119, 198 and 220 have no TVDB episode, and special S1 (the 2004 omake) would default onto the 1999 film at S0E1.",
  "upstream": "https://github.com/Anime-Lists/anime-lists/pull/629",
